<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="title">水世界</view>
    <view class="sub">3D 水中碰撞模拟器</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card desc">
    <view class="row">泳池里的水会起风浪，丢进去的模型会真的浮起来、互相撞</view>
    <view class="row">支持导入 glb / gltf / obj / fbx / stl 模型</view>
    <view class="row">风向、风力、浪高、波长都能实时调</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card notice">
    <view class="notice-title">首次进入提示</view>
    <view class="row">3D 场景在分包里，首次进入会下载约 1 MB 资源，请保持网络畅通</view>
    <view class="row">建议在性能较好的手机上体验，画面较吃 GPU</view>
  </view>

  <button class="enter" bindtap="onEnter">进入泳池</button>

  <view class="card quality">
    <view class="notice-title">画质</view>
    <view class="seg">
      <view class="seg-item {{quality==='low'?'on':''}}" data-q="low" bindtap="onQuality">流畅</view>
      <view class="seg-item {{quality==='mid'?'on':''}}" data-q="mid" bindtap="onQuality">均衡</view>
      <view class="seg-item {{quality==='high'?'on':''}}" data-q="high" bindtap="onQuality">精细</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row hint">手机发烫或卡顿时，切到「流畅」</view>
  </view>
</view>
